{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872440/extras/46fa8bc07d3da7229c71ad692b140d9a.avif?t=1767652877\" alt=\"About The Game\" width=616 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Rebel against the cops and the city, or choose good. Whatever you may choose in this world, you will grow and develop a variety of skills. You must forge your own path. Whether you decide to embrace chaos or uphold order, your decisions will shape your character and unlock unique opportunities. Build relationships, discover hidden areas, and uncover secrets in a world teeming with choices. The freedom to decide is yours, and every action paves the way for new adventures and challenges ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872440/extras/95569515e5b43916c09b1db7b45b1fbb.avif?t=1767652877\" alt=\"Road Image\" width=1500 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872440/extras/34685f22c5132ecc35458e253a31b29a.avif?t=1767652877\" width=616 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Fifteen different skills to level up, from Woodcutting to Smelting!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Three different combat skills, including attack &amp; defense!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/387